    per assinged data type.

    --B. UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP :- This tells MySQL to update the column's date and time automatically,
                                     but ONLY for the specific row that you just edited or updated.

   --  Lets create new table LOGIN and columns as Name, LoggedIn & Last_updated and assign data type for Last_updated as TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP.
       and feed data in it 

